            <strong class="text-white">1. FX Fluctuations Dropping Remuneration Below 10M JPY:</strong> If your base salary is close to the threshold (e.g., $65,000 USD) and the yen strengthens, your converted income may dip below 10M JPY at adjudication. <em>Mitigation:</em> Provide evidence of supplementary liquid financial assets or request a salary letter with an extra 10% safety cushion.
